    "intro_narrative": "You have just awakened in the forgotten sanctum of the Archmage, a sprawling, dust-covered laboratory filled with arcane artifacts, bubbling cauldrons, and dangerous latent magic. The grand runic doors have sealed shut behind you with a deafening thud, and the protective magical wards that keep the building from collapsing into the ethereal void are slowly failing. Your only hope of survival and escape lies in finding the mythical Crystal Vial, an extraordinary artifact said to hold the power to shatter any magical barrier or binding spell. However, the Archmage was notoriously paranoid, leaving behind a complex web of interconnected magical devices and hidden reliquaries. To reach your ultimate goal, you must carefully explore the sanctum, unravel the ancient enchantments, and discover how to properly channel power between these legendary relics. Time is of the essence; you must restore the flow of arcane energy and decipher the riddles before the sanctuary completely crumbles into the endless void forever.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
